{"id":1010202,"name":"어흥·심문 II","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"어흥·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1010202]}],"trial":{"trial_id":10202,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"당신과 어흥이는 함께 사자탈을 잃어버린 곳으로 돌아가 여기저기에 물어봤으나 아무것도 알아내지 못했지만, 알아서 찾아온 노숙자 한 명을 만났다. 노숙자는 사자탈에 관한 단서를 가지고 있다고 했다.","diary2":"당신들은 노숙자로부터 얻은 단서를 따라 한 골목에서 사자탈을 훔친 남자아이를 찾아냈다. 남자아이는 어흥이의 영화 속 자세를 배워 사자탈을 만지작거렸으나 원하던 집으로 돌아가는 힘은 얻지 못했다.\n　　사자탈이 힘을 줄 수 있다는 것을 증명하기 위해 어흥이는 또 다시 당신에게 자신과 함께 남자아이의 고향을 찾자는 새로운 임무를 줬다.","evidence":[{"ID":260337,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260338,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":110202022,"next":null},{"step":23,"cours